<title>USA: Holly Holdings gets casino financing.</title>
<headline>Holly Holdings gets casino financing.</headline>
<dateline>BALA CYNWYD, Pa. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holly Holdings said it recieved $10 million worth of financing to break ground on its first hotel and casino.</p>
<p>Country World Casinos, a Holly majority owned subsidiary, will run the operation in Black Hawk, Colorado.</p>
<p>The terms of the agreement call for an initial private placement financing to be provided through U2 Consulting, Inc, a subsidiary of Pacific Genesis Group.</p>
<p>Holly Holdings president, William Patrowicz told Reuters, &quot;The casino will be the largest in the state with room for 1,800 slot machines and the hotel will have 250-300 rooms.&quot;</p>
</text>
